       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BOE9F5.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CAPITAL-INTEREST     PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-PROFIT-ENTITLEMENT  PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-BENEFICIAL-OWNER    PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-CAPITAL-INTEREST
           ACCEPT WS-PROFIT-ENTITLEMENT
           IF WS-CAPITAL-INTEREST > 15
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-BENEFICIAL-OWNER
           END-IF
           IF WS-PROFIT-ENTITLEMENT > 15
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-BENEFICIAL-OWNER
           END-IF
           DISPLAY WS-BENEFICIAL-OWNER
           STOP RUN.
